# Supported site list

A site is not done until the README tables match the hostname registry.

## Registry

- New sites: `src/pages/content/injected/sites/<site>/` plus a key in `siteHostGetUrls` (`sites/index.ts`).
- Legacy tube sites (Pornhub, Xvideos, XNXX, xHamster, RedTube): keys in `hostMapGetUrls.ts`.
- Each key is `curTopDomain`: the last two hostname labels (`rou.video`, `missav.ws`). Do not add a separate row for a language subdomain such as `cn.pornhub.com`.

## Docs to update in the same change

Add, edit, or remove the same domains in every language README:

- `README.md`
- `README.en.md`
- `README.zh_CN.md`
- `README.es.md`
- `README.hi.md`
- `README.ar.md`

Sections: Supported Sites / 支持网站 / Sitios compatibles / समर्थित साइटें / المواقع المدعومة.

The display name may be translated. The domain cell must list every registry key for that site, separated by ` · `.

```markdown
| Rou.video | rou.video |
| MissAV | missav.com · missav.ws · missav.live |
```

Do not add a changelog row unless this change is part of a version release.
